cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SWOCTS Cyber Range in teaching, research, or a course, cite this repository."
title: "SWOCTS Cyber Range"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted cybersecurity training platform with isolated lab sessions,
  workbooks, automated flag scoring, competency evidence, and a signed release
  chain. SWOCTS Cyber Range is the SWOCTS-branded build of OpenCyberRange,
  based on the original Open Cyber Range (OCR-Lite) project by Lewis Heuermann.
authors:
  - family-names: Chaykoski
    given-names: Robert
    affiliation: "SWOCTS Cyber Range"
  - family-names: Heuermann
    given-names: Lewis
    note: "Original OpenCyberRange (OCR-Lite) author; upstream attribution"
version: 5.59.0
date-released: "2026-11-27"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RobChaykoski/opencyberrange"
